    }
  ],
  "returns": "\n<p>List of dictionaries of selected fields and their values.</p><p>Available fields: \n    \n    \n    <ul>\n        \n        <li >\n            \n                <p><b>id</b> -\n                    Id;</p>\n            \n            \n        </li>\n        \n        <li >\n            \n                <p><b>email</b> -\n                    Email;</p>\n            \n            \n        </li>\n        \n        <li >\n            \n                <p><b>email_description</b> -\n                    LangDict, email description;</p>\n            \n            \n        </li>\n        \n        <li >\n            \n                <p><b>is_active</b> -\n                    boolean, is email active;</p>\n            \n            \n        </li>\n        \n        <li >\n            \n                <p><b>faculty</b> - an associated faculty.</p>\n\n                \n\n                \n                    <p>This field references objects returned by\n                    <a href='https://usosapps.vistula.edu.pl/developers/api/services/fac/#faculty'>services/fac/faculty</a> method. See its <b>returns</b> section\n                    for possible subfields.</p>\n                \n            \n            \n        </li>\n        \n        <li >\n            \n                <p><b>case_category</b> - dictionary describing case category.</p>\n\n                \n\n                \n                    <p>This field references objects returned by\n                    <a href='https://usosapps.vistula.edu.pl/developers/api/services/mailclient/#case_category'>case_category</a> method. See its <b>returns</b> section\n                    for possible subfields.</p>\n                \n            \n            \n        </li>\n        \n    </ul>\n</p>",
